sequenceDiagram
 actor U as User
 participant UI as Avatar UI
 participant STT as Local STT
 participant H as Hermes
 participant MCP as MCP Gateway
 participant OS as OS Broker
 U->>UI: "Open Telegram"
 UI->>STT: Audio (if voice)
 STT-->>UI: Transcript
 UI->>H: Intent + allowed tools
 H->>MCP: list_apps(query="Telegram")
 MCP->>OS: Query installed apps
 OS-->>MCP: App IDs
 MCP-->>H: Matching apps
 H->>UI: Request launch approval
 UI->>U: Allow once / Deny
 U-->>UI: Allow once
 UI->>MCP: Approved launch_app(app_id)
 MCP->>OS: Launch app
 OS-->>MCP: Launch result
 MCP-->>H: Result
 H-->>UI: Status + expression + speech text
 UI-->>U: "Telegram is open!"
